tee-verifier-mainnet.wasm is the unmodified deployed code fetched by read-only
view_code from tee-verifier-2026-11-11.near. Its public RPC capture and expected
SHA256 are in fixtures/attest/deployment.json at the repository root.

The files named tee-verifier-TEST-ONLY are local builds of the upstream verifier
with block-clock disabled and a compile-time recording timestamp. They must
never be deployed to a public network or treated as the deployed mainnet code.
builds.json records their provenance and the build commands.

upstream/ holds byte-for-byte public test assets and their individual source
URLs and hashes. The original upstream collateral is expired at present time.
The pinned clock builds exist solely for durable offline replay in a local
near-workspaces sandbox.
